						.both(zh: "把 SSH 连接加入 Desktop 环境下拉列表。管理员用它给团队分发共享连接。你在 managed settings 里定义的连接会显示为 managed，用户可以选择它们，但不能在应用里编辑或删除。", en: "Add SSH connections to the Desktop environment dropdown. Administrators use it to distribute shared connections to a team. Connections you define in managed settings show as managed, so users can select them but can't edit or delete them in the app.")
